[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3041\u2026\u2026\u30E9\u30E9\u3068\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u3001\n\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u304C\u3063\u3066\u305F\u306D\u30FC\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... Lara and Dad were really hitting it off...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u306F\u308A\u9053\u3092\u6975\u3081\u305F\u65B9\u306F\u5C0A\u656C\u306B\u5024\u3057\u307E\u3059\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed, those who have mastered their craft are truly worthy of respect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u8A0A\u306D\u3066\u3082\u6FB1\u307F\u306A\u304F\u7B54\u3048\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3001\n\u8A18\u9332\u304C\u6357\u3063\u3066\u4ED5\u65B9\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He answered every question without hesitation. I could hardly keep up with taking notes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u3082\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u306B\u611F\u5FC3\u3057\u3066\u305F\u3088\u3002\n\u8CC7\u6599\u3082\u8A66\u4F5C\u54C1\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3063\u3061\u3082\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dad was really impressed with you too, Lara. Both your research and prototypes were amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7279\u306B\u3001\u8CC7\u6599\u306E\u71B1\u91CF\u306B\u5F53\u3066\u3089\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u3055",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He was especially blown away by how passionate your documentation was."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52E2\u3044\u3042\u307E\u3063\u3066\u3001\u65B0\u4F5C\u304C\u3067\u304D\u305F\u307F\u305F\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He got so excited, he even came up with something new!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3066\u5149\u6804\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m truly honored."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u307E\u3060\u706B\u7167\u308A\u304C\u6CBB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u308F\u3002\n\u3068\u3066\u3082\u71B1\u6C17\u306B\u6EA2\u308C\u305F\u3072\u3068\u3068\u304D\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. My heart is still racing. It was such an energetic discussion!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u3001\u601D\u308F\u305A\u306F\u3057\u3083\u3044\u3067\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I found myself getting quite carried away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u826F\u3044\u98A8\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a pleasant atmosphere..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u697D\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m glad you had such a good time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u7D20\u6027\u306E\u77E5\u308C\u306C\u76F8\u624B\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306B\u3001\n\u6E29\u304B\u304F\u3082\u3066\u306A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Despite being a stranger, I was welcomed with such warmth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u306A\uFF1F\u3000\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? That\u0027s just how we always are!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u512A\u3057\u3044\u5FAE\u7B11\u307F\u3001\u6C17\u517C\u306D\u306E\u306A\u3044\u4F1A\u8A71\u2026\u2026\n\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306B\u306F\u5F97\u96E3\u304D\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3057\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The gentle smiles, the casual conversation... These are precious gifts to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u304A\u8336\u3088\u308A\u3082\n\u5FC3\u306B\u6E29\u3082\u308A\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They warm the heart more than any tea ever could."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3060\u3001\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u305D\u308C\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306E\u60C5\u71B1\u3092\n\u9802\u6234\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3051\u308C\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though today, I received even more passion than that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u3082\u30E9\u30E9\u306E\u8CC7\u6599\u306B\n\u305A\u30FC\u3063\u3068\u91D8\u4ED8\u3051\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3082\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Dad couldn\u0027t take his eyes off your research materials!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306D\u3048\u3001\u3053\u306E\u307E\u307E\u672C\u306B\u3057\u3061\u3083\u304A\u3046\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, why don\u0027t we turn it into a book?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u8A98\u60D1\u3057\u307E\u3059\u306E\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How tempting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3067\u306F\u3068\u3066\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But this isn\u0027t nearly enough..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And besides..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u4E00\u5EA6\u3001\u672C\u3092\u66F8\u304F\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306A\u3089\u3070\u3001\n\u4EE5\u524D\u3068\u7570\u306A\u308B\u601D\u3044\u3067\u5411\u304D\u5408\u3044\u305F\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I were to write another book, I\u0027d want to approach it with different feelings than before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u524D\u306F\u3001\u3064\u3089\u3044\u6642\u671F\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was a difficult time for you, wasn\u0027t it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u305F\u3060\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u306B\u8A8D\u3081\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3044\u305F\u3044\u2026\u2026\n\u305D\u306E\u4E00\u5FC3\u3067\u3001\u53EB\u3076\u3088\u3046\u306B\u7DB4\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I wrote frantically then, desperate for recognition..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\u306E\u306B\u3001\u4E0D\u601D\u8B70\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...And yet, how strange it is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u751F\u307E\u308C\u305F\u672C\u304C\u5171\u611F\u3055\u308C\u3001\n\u9577\u304F\u611B\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That such a book would resonate with others and be cherished for so long."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u306F\u3001\n\u5B9D\u7269\u307F\u305F\u3044\u306A\u672C\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. To Resna, it\u0027s like a precious treasure."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u8AAD\u8005\u304C\u73FE\u308C\u3088\u3046\u3068\u306F\u3001\n\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3082\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I never imagined I\u0027d find a reader like her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u3092\u66F8\u304F\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u76F8\u624B\u306B\u5C4A\u304F\u306E\u306A\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If writing books can reach people like that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B21\u306F\u3001\u3072\u305F\u3080\u304D\u306B\u547C\u3073\u304B\u3051\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next time, I want to write with sincerity."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F7C\u5973\u305F\u3061\u306E\u80CC\u4E2D\u3092\u62BC\u305B\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3001\n\uFF11\u518A\u306B\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d like to create something that can encourage others, like her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u60C5\u71B1\u304C\u3001\u30E9\u30E9\u306B\u97FF\u3044\u3066\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Resna\u0027s passion is really resonating with Lara.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u304C\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u5171\u9CF4\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Just like it did with Dad, they\u0027re in perfect sync!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\u3042\u306E\u8CC7\u6599\u3088\u308A\u5206\u539A\u304F\u306A\u308B\u306E\uFF1F\n\u982D\u304C\u3050\u308B\u3050\u308B\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046\u3088\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? So it\u0027ll be even thicker than those notes? My head\u0027s already spinning!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u5B89\u5FC3\u306A\u3055\u3044\u306A\u3002\n\u672C\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Don\u0027t worry. I won\u0027t be making it into a book."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306E\u308F\u305F\u304F\u3057\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u306F\u3042\u304F\u307E\u3067\u3082\u3001\n\u30E9\u30E9\u30FB\u30AD\u30F3\u30B0\u30C0\u30E0\u767A\u5C55\u306E\u305F\u3081\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My current research is solely for the development of the Lara Kingdom..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7686\u306E\u559C\u3073\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For everyone\u0027s happiness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30E9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u521D\u3081\u3066\u4F1A\u3063\u305F\u6642\u306F\u5ACC\u306A\u5974\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306B\u3001\n\u3000\u4ECA\u65E5\u306E\u30E9\u30E9\u306F\u3059\u3054\u304F\u512A\u3057\u3044\u9854\u3092\u3057\u3066\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(When we first met, I thought she was awful, but today Lara\u0027s face is so gentle.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304A\u7236\u3055\u3093\u305F\u3061\u306B\u4F1A\u308F\u305B\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u524D\u306E\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u77E5\u3063\u305F\u3089\u9A5A\u304F\u3060\u308D\u3046\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If my past self knew I\u0027d introduce her to Dad and the others, she\u0027d be shocked!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3060\u3051\u3069\u4ECA\u306E\u30E9\u30E9\u306A\u3089\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u3082\u3063\u3068\u5FDC\u63F4\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3063\u3066\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3088\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But seeing Lara now... it just makes me want to support her even more.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]